00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Clunk every time you hit a bump?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The way it happens is one clue.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Clunk on rough roads, steering feels fine?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
That can point to a sway bar link.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Clunk while turning AND hitting a bump?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
That may indicate a ball joint.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Left alone, worn parts add up.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Worth checking before a road trip.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess — we check the full suspension free.

